      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TOP THE LOT (3) lines up chasing another win after scorching around this track over 350m in 18.86 on July 30. Top win latest and looms as the one to beat again. HE'S DELIRIOUS (2) has a strong record this trip including three wins from six starts. Comes off a (20.13) win last time, scoring by one length in a P5 over 366m at Capalaba. Makes strong appeal on best. ZABDON JUSTICE (1) wasn't far away at the finish when 5th and beaten only 2.5 lengths (16.92) at this track. Has a good record here at this journey. Can do much better this time. GRUBBER KICK (8) had been going along well and was strongly fancied last time but could only manage fifth (22.15) at Q Lakeside. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely.",
